heading:
  text: Birthday cakes
  image:
    path: backgrounds/birthday-balloons
    alt: Birthday background
productExamples:
- name: Buttercream cakes
  description: Buttercream cakes are finished completely in buttercream in either one or more colours to produce the desired effect. The finish can be smooth or textured.
  examples:
  - shades-of-chocolate
  - shades-of-pink-and-gold-fault-line-flowers
  - pink-ombre-daisies
- name: Fondant cakes
  description: Cakes are covered in a smooth layer of sugarpaste and can be decorated with flowers, objects or figures modelled from fondant icing.
  examples:
  - flower-elegance
  - come-fly-with-me
- name: Themed cakes
  description: Themed cakes allow the design to be tailored to the recipient in terms of their likes, hobbies and personality for example.
  examples:
  - ready-set-go-kart
  - hp-slytherin-edition
  - birthday-books
- name: Birthday cupcakes
  description: Birthday cupcakes are easy to share and customise with a decoration of your choice. If some of your party have dietary requirements, cupcakes are a good way to cater for them separately. Cupcakes can also make a special birthday gift and can be presented in a gift box finished with ribbon and a bow and candle.
  examples:
  - rose-mix
- name: Carved cakes
  description: Cut to the desired shape, hand carved cakes bring to life the cake design.
  examples:
  - parker-penguin
  - prime-ice-pop
- name: Edible images
  description: Edible images can be placed on either a buttercream or fondant finished cake. They offer greater design flexibility and are cheaper than fondant models. An edible image of a favourite photograph will also add that personal touch.
  examples:
  - let-it-go
  - pink-and-bluey
  - football-print-arsenal
- name: Airbrushing
  description: Airbrushing adds an exciting dimension to a fondant cake, introducing additional colour either as an abstract or block design. Blending the colours can also add depth.
  examples:
  - psychedelic-symphony
- name: Pinata cakes
  description: These cakes have a hidden surprise and have a special appeal to children. They can be filled with sweets or chocolate.
  examples:
  - easter-surprise
